---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { GOOGLE_FORM_URL } from '../../site.config.mjs';
---
<Base title="Submit Feedback or a Correction" description="Report a wrong or outdated ChatGPT plugin rule, suggest a new check, or share feedback about the PluginLint tools." crumbName="Submit feedback">
  <h1>Submit feedback or a correction</h1>
  <p class="lede">Spotted a limit that changed, a check that misfires, or a rule we’re missing? Tell us.</p>
  {GOOGLE_FORM_URL ? (
    <p><a class="btn" href={GOOGLE_FORM_URL} rel="noopener">Open the feedback form (Google Forms)</a></p>
  ) : (
    <div class="todo">
      <p><strong>TODO (site owner):</strong> create a Google Form and set <code>GOOGLE_FORM_URL</code> in <code>site.config.mjs</code>. Until then there is no form on this page.</p>
    </div>
  )}
  <p>PluginLint itself does not collect anything on this page. The form, once linked, is hosted by Google.</p>
  <h2>Helpful details to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The rule or tool, and what you expected.</li>
    <li>A link to the OpenAI doc section that shows the correct rule.</li>
    <li>For false positives in the privacy auditor: the key name and a <em>fake</em> example value — never real customer data.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
